      "provider": {
        "name": "deepseek-tri",
        "version": "1.0.0",
        "mode": "json_single"
      },
      "summaries": {
        "en": "fff.nvim is a high-performance file search toolkit that solves the problem of slow and inaccurate file navigation in development environments, particularly for AI agents and code editors like Neovim. Its technical strength lies in using Rust for blazing-fast indexing and fuzzy matching algorithms that deliver precise results even with typos. Developers can integrate it into their workflows through Neovim plugins or directly in Rust/C/NodeJS projects to quickly locate files during coding sessions or when building AI tools that need efficient file system access.",
        "zh": "fff.nvim 是一款高性能文件搜索工具包，专门解决开发环境中文件导航速度慢、准确率低的问题，尤其适用于 AI 智能体和 Neovim 等代码编辑器。其核心技术在于采用 Rust 语言实现极速索引和模糊匹配算法，即使输入存在拼写错误也能精准返回结果。开发者可通过 Neovim 插件直接集成到编辑环境，或在 Rust/C/NodeJS 项目中调用其 API，实现在编码时快速定位文件，或为需要高效文件访问的 AI 工具提供底层支持。该设计展示了如何通过系统级优化提升开发工具链的响应效率。",
        "es": "fff.nvim is a high-performance file search toolkit that solves the problem of slow and inaccurate file navigation in development environments, particularly for AI agents and code editors like Neovim. Its technical strength lies in using Rust for blazing-fast indexing and fuzzy matching algorithms that deliver precise results even with typos. Developers can integrate it into their workflows through Neovim plugins or directly in Rust/C/NodeJS projects to quickly locate files during coding sessions or when building AI tools that need efficient file system access.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "fff.nvim stands out for filesearch, lua, and neovim in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "fff.nvim is a high-performance file search toolkit that solves the problem of slow and inaccurate file navigation in development environments, particularly for AI agents and code editors like Neovim. Its technical strength lies in using Rust for blazing-fast indexing and fuzzy matching algorithms that deliver precise results even with typos. Developers can integrate it into their workflows through Neovim plugins or directly in Rust/C/NodeJS projects to quickly locate files during coding sessions or when building AI tools that need efficient file system access.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/dmtrKovalenko/fff.nvim for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
